## Model card

- **Name:** Qoduck (Stealth Model — identity undisclosed)
- **Short description:** Alibaba's stealth coding model released on Qoder International platform November 7, 2026. Identity not disclosed by vendor; community speculates Qwen-family (possibly Qwen 4 Max preview variant). Offered free to individual users during limited promotion (Nov 7–11, 2026); removed after promotion ended.
- **Provider / access:** Qoder International (Alibaba Cloud) — model picker entry `qoduck`. Available only in Qoder International app (not IDE, JetBrains plugin, or CLI). Individual users only (Free, Pro, Pro+, Ultra plans); enterprise subscribers (Teams/Enterprise) excluded. Free daily allowance during promotion; standard rate 0.5× Credits after allowance.
- **Release / knowledge:** Promo launch 2026-11-07 (Singapore time); promotion ended 2026-11-11 10:00 UTC+8. Model identity undisclosed by vendor; knowledge cutoff not published. Model removed after promotion.
- **IDs:** `qoduck` (Qoder International model picker only). No public API, no Hugging Face, no OpenCode Zen ID, no OpenRouter entry.
- **Context window:** Not officially confirmed. Community reports claim ~1M tokens; Qoder docs do not specify. No official documentation of context length.
- **Modalities:** Text input/output (coding-focused). Reasoning: yes (supports adjustable thinking intensity per Qoder docs). Tool calls: not documented. JSON mode: not documented. No image/audio/video input documented.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** Promotion ended. During promotion: free daily allowance (0.0× Credits); standard rate 0.5× Credits (Qoder credit system). No direct $ pricing published. No longer available after promotion ended 2026-11-11.
- **Architecture:** Undisclosed. Speculated Qwen-family (tokenizer clues per community). Parameter count not disclosed. Proprietary, not open weights. Stealth model — vendor has not disclosed identity.

